
Pulogalamu kasamalidwe-ka-kukumbukira: 4.

>> Animal := Chinthu chatsopano.
Animal chikafika: ['makeSound'] chitani: {
	Zotuluka lembani: ['?'].
}.
>> Cat := Animal chatsopano.
Cat chikafika: ['makeSound'] chitani: {
	Zotuluka lembani: ['meow!'].
	wekha makeSound. 
}.
>> Tom := Cat chatsopano.
Tom makeSound.
